      "content": "exactly. it’s like we’re being forced to endure this slow-motion apocalypse just because society tells us we have to. but if it’s truly as inevitable as the science says, then isn't there something almost kind about just opting out early? like, why endure all that suffering and witness the destruction when you could just choose a moment of peace instead?",
